### Feature Client — CREATE

### Leyenda: SIN AUTH (sin middleware JWT / sin autenticación)

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
### Feature User — CREATE / UPDATE / DELETE (modalidad JWT + RBAC)
## iniciar sesion como admin



@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

# @name loginAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sesion/login
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "wesly.usuario1",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

###
@token = {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.access_token}}



### listar clientes
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/clientes  
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### consultar clientes 
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/clientes/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### crear cliente
# @name createClient
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/clientes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ana Pérez",
  "address": "Calle 10 #20-30",
  "phone": "3001234567",
  "email": "ana.perez@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "status": "active"
}
